@baseUrl = http://localhost:5080

### Create a crawl job
# @name create
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json
X-Correlation-Id: demo-123

{
  "url": "https://example.com",
  "maxDepth": 2
}

### Job status and progress
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{create.response.body.jobId}}

### Tree of crawled pages
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{create.response.body.jobId}}/tree

### Outgoing links of a page (take a pageId from the tree)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{create.response.body.jobId}}/pages/1/links

### History (most recent first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs?page=1&pageSize=20

### Cancel
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs/{{create.response.body.jobId}}/cancel

### Validation error (400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/jobs
Content-Type: application/json

{ "url": "mailto:someone@example.com", "maxDepth": 9 }

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Worker health
GET http://localhost:5081/health
